.TH SAVE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
Save \- The folder save slots are written to
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqsave.h\(dq
.ft B
typedef struct Save { char dir[512]; } Save;
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The folder save slots are written to. The engine fills Engine.save during engine_init() from EngineConfig.org and app (a per\-user folder such as ~/.local/share/org/app/ or the platform equivalent), or the current directory when either is NULL. Games only ever pass &e\->save.
.SH FIELDS
.TP
.B dir
absolute path with a trailing separator
.SH MODULE
save (src/engine/save/save.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR save_write (3),
.BR save_load (3),
.BR EngineConfig (3),
.BR gge\-saves (7),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
